[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0125","question_id":"CQ-Q0125","question_text":"达人建联是什么意思？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"清洗版补充池","sample_date":"2026-10-12","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":12,"valid_url_cards":12,"unique_url_events":11,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"fd1036f412fb3f3e5becb53e79f4c346b421dbffcfc5bc06eb6ad6c18f92581e","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":true,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# 达人建联\n**达人建联（达人BD）**：商家/品牌主动筛选、联系平台达人（短视频/直播创作者），洽谈带货、广告内容合作的整套动作，是抖音、小红书、TikTok电商里的常用词。\n\n简单说：**主动去找网红谈合作**。\n\n## 完整流程\n1. 筛选达人：按垂类、粉丝画像、播放/带货数据挑匹配账号\n2. 发起触达：平台后台邀约、私信、邮件联系达人\n3. 商务洽谈：谈佣金、坑位费、样品、视频/直播脚本、排期\n4. 确认合作：签协议/平台下单、寄样、达人产出内容带货\n5. 履约跟进：跟踪发布、数据复盘，维护达人资源\n\n## 两种合作模式\n- **纯佣金合作**：无坑位费，卖出货达人拿佣金，新店冷启动最常用（很多腰尾部达人）\n- **付费合作**：坑位费+佣金，多用于中头部达人，风险更高\n\n## 岗位\n**达人BD**，就是专门做达人建联的人，负责批量触达、对接达人。\n\n## 区分两个概念\n- **建联**：主动邀约达人（定向合作）\n- **公开联盟**：商品上架联盟广场，达人自己来找你，不属于建联\n\n如果你需要，我可以给你一份**达人建联私信邀约话术模板**。","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0125","question_id":"CQ-Q0125","citation_id":"smp-04fca2768fc948698cff715d4f71ee91:1","title":"联系达人-星图营销服务平台","raw_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/109165","normalized_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/109165","host":"www.xingtu.cn","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0125","question_id":"CQ-Q0125","citation_id":"smp-04fca2768fc948698cff715d4f71ee91:2","title":"巨量创意","raw_url":"https://cc.oceanengine.com/academy/article-detail/8a60b0734f83ca42b84abc79ca530bda","normalized_url":"https://cc.oceanengine.com/academy/article-detail/8a60b0734f83ca42b84abc79ca530bda","host":"cc.oceanengine.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0125","question_id":"CQ-Q0125","citatio